{
  "uid": "ai-usage-live",
  "title": "AI Usage — Live por instancia, provider y modelo",
  "description": "Vista viva del consumo de agentes de IA en toda la flota. Todas las series son gauges agregados por ventana (ADR-001): ninguna expresion usa rate() ni increase(), porque sobre estos snapshots no significan nada. La ventana 1h es la que se mueve; $window controla los paneles comparativos.",
  "tags": [
    "ai-usage",
    "live"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": [
      "5s",
      "10s",
      "30s",
      "1m",
      "5m",
      "15m"
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "refresh": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "instance",
        "label": "Instancia",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(ai_usage_tokens, instance)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        },
        "sort": 1,
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "tool",
        "label": "Provider",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(ai_usage_tokens{instance=~\"$instance\"}, tool)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        },
        "sort": 1,
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "model",
        "label": "Modelo",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(ai_usage_tokens{instance=~\"$instance\", tool=~\"$tool\"}, model)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        },
        "sort": 1,
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "window",
        "label": "Ventana comparativa",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "1h,24h,7d,30d,mtd,all",
        "multi": false,
        "includeAll": false,
        "current": {
          "text": "24h",
          "value": "24h"
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "1h",
            "value": "1h",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "24h",
            "value": "24h",
            "selected": true
          },
          {
            "text": "7d",
            "value": "7d",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "30d",
            "value": "30d",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "mtd",
            "value": "mtd",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "all",
            "value": "all",
            "selected": false
          }
        ],
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Ahora: tokens (1h)",
      "description": "Tokens consumidos en la ultima hora, sumados sobre $instance / $tool / $model. Ventana deslizante 1h de ai_usage_tokens: es un gauge por ventana (ADR-001), NUNCA aplicar rate() ni increase().",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "graphMode": "area",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(ai_usage_tokens{window=\"1h\", instance=~\"$instance\", tool=~\"$tool\", model=~\"$model\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "id": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Ahora: coste (1h)",
      "description": "Coste en USD de la ultima hora para la seleccion actual. Deriva de ai_usage_cost_usd, que ya aplica las tarifas de models.dev; un modelo sin tarifa aporta 0 y aparece en la tabla de detalle.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 4
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "graphMode": "area",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(ai_usage_cost_usd{window=\"1h\", instance=~\"$instance\", tool=~\"$tool\", model=~\"$model\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "id": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Instancias reportando",
      "description": "Cuantos exporters distintos estan publicando metricas dentro de $instance. Si baja, un host dejo de ser scrapeado: compara con la frescura de al lado.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "graphMode": "none",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "count(count by (instance) (ai_usage_scan_timestamp_seconds{instance=~\"$instance\"}))",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "id": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Frescura maxima del escaneo",
      "description": "Antiguedad del snapshot mas viejo entre las instancias seleccionadas (time() - ai_usage_scan_timestamp_seconds). Con scan_interval por defecto de 60s debe quedarse por debajo de 120s. Si sube, un reescaneo esta fallando y las cifras de arriba estan congeladas.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 120
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 300
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "graphMode": "none",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max(time() - ai_usage_scan_timestamp_seconds{instance=~\"$instance\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "id": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tokens 1h por instancia",
      "description": "La curva de uso continuo, separada por maquina. Cada punto es 'tokens de la ultima hora' en el momento de ese scrape. Un tramo plano es el exporter sin reescanear, no ausencia de uso.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "pointSize": 8,
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "axisGridShow": true,
            "gradientMode": "none"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (instance) (ai_usage_tokens{window=\"1h\", instance=~\"$instance\", tool=~\"$tool\", model=~\"$model\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 5
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tokens 1h por provider",
      "description": "Mismo periodo, desglosado por herramienta. Los colores estan fijados por provider (claude-code azul, codex naranja, opencode violeta) para que filtrar no repinte las series supervivientes.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "pointSize": 8,
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "axisGridShow": true,
            "gradientMode": "none"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "claude-code"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#3274D9"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "codex"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#D9730D"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "opencode"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#A050C8"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (tool) (ai_usage_tokens{window=\"1h\", instance=~\"$instance\", tool=~\"$tool\", model=~\"$model\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series",
          "legendFormat": "{{tool}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 6
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tokens 1h por modelo (top 8)",
      "description": "Los 8 modelos con mas consumo en la ultima hora. Esta acotado a 8 a proposito: por encima de ocho series categoricas los colores dejan de ser distinguibles. El resto de modelos esta en la tabla de detalle de abajo.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "pointSize": 8,
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "axisGridShow": true,
            "gradientMode": "none"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "topk(8, sum by (model) (ai_usage_tokens{window=\"1h\", instance=~\"$instance\", tool=~\"$tool\", model=~\"$model\"}))",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 7
    },
    {
      "type": "barchart",
      "title": "Clases de token por instancia (1h)",
      "description": "Reparto input / output / cache_read / cache_write / reasoning por maquina. Las cinco clases son disjuntas (ADR-004): cada token se cuenta una sola vez. Es el panel que hace visible el ahorro por cache.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 12
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 85,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "axisGridShow": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "showValue": "auto",
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        },
        "xTickLabelRotation": 0,
        "barRadius": 0.1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (instance, token_type) (ai_usage_tokens{window=\"1h\", instance=~\"$instance\", tool=~\"$tool\", model=~\"$model\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "time_series",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}} · {{token_type}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 8
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Coste 1h por instancia",
      "description": "Gasto en USD de la ultima hora por maquina. Panel separado del de tokens a proposito: tokens y dolares tienen escalas distintas y un eje doble inventaria una correlacion que no esta en los datos.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "pointSize": 8,
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "axisGridShow": true,
            "gradientMode": "none"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (instance) (ai_usage_cost_usd{window=\"1h\", instance=~\"$instance\", tool=~\"$tool\", model=~\"$model\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 9
    },
    {
      "type": "barchart",
      "title": "Coste por modelo (ventana $window)",
      "description": "Gasto por modelo en la ventana elegida en $window. Usa la variable para comparar la hora actual contra 24h, 7d, 30d, el mes en curso o todo el historial disponible.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 20
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 85,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "axisGridShow": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "showValue": "auto",
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        },
        "xTickLabelRotation": 0,
        "barRadius": 0.1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (model) (ai_usage_cost_usd{window=\"$window\", instance=~\"$instance\", tool=~\"$tool\", model=~\"$model\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "time_series",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 10
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Detalle por modelo (ventana $window)",
      "description": "Todos los modelos de la seleccion, no solo el top 8: tokens y coste en la ventana $window, con su instancia y su provider. Es la vista de tabla que acompana a los paneles de color, para que la identidad de una serie nunca dependa solo del color.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Tokens"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "short"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "gauge",
                  "mode": "gradient"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Coste USD"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "currencyUSD"
              },
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 4
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "footer": {
          "show": true,
          "reducer": [
            "sum"
          ],
          "countRows": false,
          "fields": ""
        },
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "desc": true,
            "displayName": "Tokens"
          }
        ]
      },
